{"title":"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f43a17aee568102e4d5b84a7ea5d7414bba48fa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 + 10^{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4db411d753d66733d4f311553b9a080d1d51984d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 2.0 \\times 10^{3} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 8.0 \\times 10^{3} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 4.0 \\times 10^{1} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 1.0 \\times 10^{4} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 1.01 \\times 10^{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"707\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/f/fdf5814548e1342e01e13f787b8d13daadfb813e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 + 10^{3} = 10 + 1000 = 1010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"229\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Converting this into scientific notation, like the answer choices have, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/f/d2f241c58de0703ed600bcf6891074f9361d1182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1010 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 1.01 \\times 10^{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"188\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal\">1999 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/